the Technocracy call hobgoblins?<br /> That is, &quot;hobgoblin&quot; sounds like a Traditions term. I imagine the Union uses some pseudo scientific sounding term.<br /> What do you think?</div> </div> </div> </div>I have three ideas / examples:<br /> Hobgoblin-Derived Entities<br /> Goblinoid Manifestations<br /> Goblin Creature-Entitites<br /> <br /> I see no clear / definite reasons against Technocrats directly using words, phrases, or terms which have at least some technical and practical relevancy, and that also can certainly be characteristic and recognizable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-30T16:42:30-08:00","id":1498484,"title":"","content":"Aliens. In my games, the average Technocrat views absolutely everything from the Middle and Astral Umbrae as literal aliens.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-01T13:15:20-08:00","id":1498571,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1497673-what-does-the-technocracy-call-hobgoblins?p=1497704#post1497704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One term that I heard from other games and that I like a lot is EDE (Extra dimensional entities), but that is a generic term for any being that's not from our home dimension. In this particular case, you could also use these that I just invented: HOB (Hostile oneiric being), PPM (Predatory Psychic Manifestation), DDI (Disruptive dream intruder), or FMC (Folklore mimic creature)</div> </div> </div> </div>I am so using HOB.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-03T21:13:03-08:00","id":1498735,"title":"","content":"Maybe Gremlins, since the origin of the term has to do with malfunctioning technology?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3505,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","user":"Matt the Bruins fan","date":". 12-04-2022, 12:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"